msgstr "Version %(v)s · since %(date)s · %(c)s confidence."

#: app/templates/nutrition/plan.html:25
msgid "Si cambia tu situación u objetivo, actualiza el cuestionario y volveremos a calcular."
msgstr "If your situation or your goal changes, update the questionnaire and we will work it out again."

